v0.1.0  2026-11-10
--------------------
Add OAuth::AccessToken to support Shopify expiring tokens
Add :refresh option to Request to automatically refresh expiring tokens
Add shopify_api:graphql:request:migrate_access_tokens Rake task for non-expiring token migration

v0.0.2  2026-04-19
--------------------
Require TinyGID >= 0.1.2. This version allows one to call #parse and #to_s methods on #gid.
Make #transform_keys private to communicate to implementors that it should not be called
